nfiguration-111","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"The `maxInteractDistance` directly affects performance. A lower value means fewer interactions are checked and rendered each frame."},"799":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-112","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Set `hideWhenEmpty.models = true` if model targets should lose their marker when `canInteract` returns false. An option can set `hideWhenEmpty = true` or `false` to override the type default. The marker only hides when every option on the target wants to hide."},"800":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-113","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Interact is registered as a FiveM keybind (`interact_action`). Players rebind it in GTA Settings → Key Bindings → FiveM. The prompt reads the live mapping, so the keycap updates after they leave the pause menu."},"801":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-114","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#distant-indicator","content":"`config.indicator` is the mark on targets that are in range but are not the open prompt. Set it to `sprite` for `IndicatorSprite`, or to an id from the gallery. Click a name to copy it."},"802":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-115","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#distant-indicator","content":"The marker stays white. Its second color is the theme accent, or `config.themeColor` when that is set. `wedge` does not take the accent."},"803":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-116","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#distant-indicator","content":"`indicatorScale` sizes every CSS marker the same way. `IndicatorSprite.scale` sizes only the sprite."},"804":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-117","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#distant-indicator","content":"A custom marker is a file at `web/indicators/<id>.css` whose loader is a `<span class=\"loader\">`. `--color-1` is white and `--color-2` is the accent."},"805":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-118","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`config.theme` selects the prompt skin. Each built-in look has its own accent in `config.themeColors`. Leave `config.themeColor` as `nil` unless you want one color on every theme."},"806":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-119","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Id"},"807":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-120","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Description"},"808":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-121","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`legacy`"},"809":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-122","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Original prompt. Dark rows, Roboto, and a blue fill on the selected row"},"810":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-123","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`modern`"},"811":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-124","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Black plates and white type. The selected row is a white plate with black type. Hold draws a ring around the key"},"812":{"i