 plates with a magenta-to-cyan rim. The selected row glows"},"822":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-135","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`kawaii`"},"823":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-136","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Pale plates and rose type. The key is a circle with a pink ring. The selected row is solid pink"},"824":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-137","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`industrial`"},"825":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-138","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Square riveted plates. A hazard stripe runs along the bottom of the selected row"},"826":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-139","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"`fantasy`"},"827":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-140","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"Dark plates, serif type, and gold corner brackets"},"828":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-141","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"An option's `color` field still overrides the accent for that row only. See Interact Options."},"829":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-142","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#themes","content":"To add your own look, see Custom Themes."},"830":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-143","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"When `compactOptions` is `true` (the default), a target with **more than one option** starts as a single `INTERACT` label."},"831":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-144","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"Press E once to open the list."},"832":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-145","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"Press E again to select the highlighted option. Hold E for options with `holdTime`."},"833":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-146","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"Scroll moves the highlight. The list follows when the highlight leaves the visible rows."},"834":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-147","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"After a selection, or after `compactIdleMs` with no activity, the list collapses back to `INTERACT`."},"835":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-148","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"A hold in progress will not collapse."},"836":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-149","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#compact-prompt","content":"Targets with a single option always show that option. Set `compactOptions` to `false` to always show the full list."},"837":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-150","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#locales","content":"Compact prompt copy uses ox\\_lib locales. English ships in `locales/en.json`. Add another file (for example `locales/fr.json`) to translate it; ox\\_lib merges that over English using the player's langua