tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"One group per point, while the player is in range of that point"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-125","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Local entity or network id"},"3571":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-126","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"That entity's prompts, plus model and global prompts when it is the closest match"},"3572":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-127","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Model"},"3573":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-128","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"The closest entity of that model"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-129","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Global ped, vehicle, object, or player"},"3575":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-130","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"The closest entity of that type"},"3576":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-131","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Model prompts and global prompts attach to that closest entity. Prompts registered on the entity itself are merged into the same group, specific ones first, then model, then global. A second car nearby does not get a second copy of a global vehicle prompt."},"3577":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-132","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"`canInteract` receives `(entity, distance, coords, name)`. Coord targets pass `entity` as `0`. The action payload adds `entity`, `coords`, `distance`, and `coordId` when the prompt is tied to a target. `serverEvent` sends a network id instead of the client handle, or `0` when the entity is local."},"3578":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-133","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"`hide` and `hideAll` clear the HUD. They do not unregister a world target, so a prompt in range comes back on the next check. `remove*` drops it. Stopping the resource that registered it drops it too."},"3579":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-134","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Parameter"},"3580":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-135","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Type"},"3581":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-136","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Description"},"3582":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-137","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`coords`"},"3583":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-138","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`vector3 \\| vector3[]`"},"3584":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-139","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"One point, an array of points, or `{ x, y, z }`"},"3585":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-140","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url